  "description": "XOHXEZ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H54 N4 O20 Yb4 2+,3(C1 H4 O1),Cl4 Zn1 2-. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.594-3.749 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.10-108.98°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb4L2(OAc)4(μ3-OH)2(H2O)2](ZnCl4)·3CH3OH; anal. calcd C55H66Cl4N4O23Yb4Zn. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
